    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nOffers in Excess of 349,000\n\n\nOur Lady's Island is a quaint Wexford Village, minutes drive from St. Margaret's and Carne beaches. The village is synonymous with its “horse shoe\" island, which is surrounded by a lake. A lovely tranquil 25 minute walk gets you around it. This area is a bird watcher's paradise.\nThe Lakeside development is small,well managed and situated in the heart of the village. A pub, church, Londis Shop and garage are within a short stroll of the property.\nNumber 4 is a detached three bedroom dormer bungalow. It has a back garden that is sunny for most of the day, it also comes with the benefit of enjoying shelter and complete privacy. Accommodation includes a kitchen; large living room (spanning the width of the house), bathroom and bedroom downstairs and two further large bedrooms and a bathroom upstairs, the main bedroom has access into a bathroom and a large balcony which in turn has access to the rear garden via a spiral staircase\nThe estate is occupied by both permanent and holiday home owners and enjoys a range of beautiful walks in the immediate locality.\nRosslare Strand and Wexford Town are both within a fifteen minute drive."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 3.77m x 2m\nWith lofted ceiling, tiled flooring and understairs storage.\n\nLiving Room - 6m x 3.4m\nSpanning the width of the house and benefitting from windows on three sides (including sliding doors which access a large raised stone patio area) and an open fireplace. This large room has ample space for a combined seating and dining area, it enjoyes double door access into the kitchen.\n\nKitchen / Dining Area - 3.5m x 2.9m\nWith waist and eye level storage, tiled flooring and splashbacks and door access to the rear raised patio and garden.\n\nDownstairs bedroom 1 - 3.52m x 3.2m\nA downstairs bedroom is a great bonus in any home.\n\nBathroom - 2.4m x 1.97m\nWith part tiled walls, bath, w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nLanding - 2.57m x 1m\n\n\nBedroom 2 (Jack & Jill Ensuite) - 4.83m x 3.46m\nWith double door access to large rear balcony which has a spiral staircase to the rear garden. Views of the lake....Has door access to the bathroom.\n\nBathroom - 2.72m x 2.66m\nWith Velux Window, Triton T90 Electric Shower, w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.18m x 3.52m\n\n\nHot Press - \n\n\n"
      },
